# Track 2 — apps/admin-v2 manifest & workspace wiring patch

Applies to: the admin-v2 shell built on branch `pi-workflow/wf_13fa075ee678/3`
(committed `apps/admin-v2/`). This patch carries the manifest/config wiring that
the track could not write into root manifests (`bun.lock`), and documents what
the integrator must do after merging the branch.

## What the branch already contains (no action needed)

- Full `apps/admin-v2/` app: Solid + Vite SPA, TanStack Solid Router (file
  routes), TanStack Solid Query, tRPC admin client, variant B shell, PWA config,
  `src/routeTree.gen.ts` (generated, committed).
- Root `package.json` needs **no edit**: the root workspace already globs
  `apps/*`, so `admin-v2` joins the workspace automatically.
- `turbo.json` needs no edit: `build` / `check-types` / `lint` tasks are
  workspace-generic.

## Step 1 — install (updates bun.lock)

```sh
bun install
```

`bun.lock` will gain one new direct dependency, `@tanstack/solid-router`
(pinned **1.133.15** to match the already-locked `@tanstack/router-core@1.133.15`
and `@tanstack/history@1.133.3`; a `^` would pull 1.17x and drag newer
router-core in). All other deps already exist in the lockfile.

## Step 2 — verify

```sh
bun run --filter admin-v2 check-types   # tsgo --noEmit
bun run --filter admin-v2 build         # vite build
bun run --filter admin-v2 check         # biome check
```

