## src/main.tsx (exact contents)

```tsx
import "@fontsource-variable/onest";
import { QueryClientProvider } from "@tanstack/solid-query";
import { createRouter, RouterProvider } from "@tanstack/solid-router";
import type { SolidNode } from "@tanstack/solid-router";
import { render } from "solid-js/web";

import { AppLoading } from "@/app/app-loading";
import { queryClient } from "@/lib/query-client";
import { routeTree } from "./routeTree.gen";
import "./styles/app.css";

const router = createRouter({
	routeTree,
	context: { queryClient },
	defaultPreload: "intent",
	defaultPreloadStaleTime: 30_000,
	defaultPendingComponent: AppLoading,
	defaultPendingMs: 100,
	defaultPendingMinMs: 300,
	scrollRestoration: true,
	Wrap: (props: { children: SolidNode }) => (
		<QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>
			{props.children}
		</QueryClientProvider>
	),
});

declare module "@tanstack/solid-router" {
	interface Register {
		router: typeof router;
	}
}

const rootElement = document.getElementById("app");

if (!rootElement) {
	throw new Error("Root element not found");
}

render(() => <RouterProvider router={router} />, rootElement);
```

## src/routeTree.gen.ts

Generated by the TanStack Router vite plugin (`tanstackRouter({ target: "solid" })`)
from the files in `src/routes/`. Committed on the branch; the plugin rewrites it
on every dev/build. No manual edits.

## Deploy wiring (integration step 7 of the rewrite plan)

`apps/admin-v2/alchemy.run.ts` mirrors `apps/admin/alchemy.run.ts` (app
`admin-v2`, `VITE_SERVER_URL` binding, `bun run dev:vite`). Prod/staging domains
are deliberately left unset — the integrator assigns them at cutover.

## Notes

- The worktree typecheck/build used a local, uncommitted copy of
  `@tanstack/solid-router@1.133.15` under `apps/admin-v2/node_modules/`
  (gitignored). After `bun install` the real lockfile entry replaces it.
- `src/tmp-ui/` holds temporary Button/Badge/EmptyState/InlineAlert stubs, each
  marked `TODO: SWAP TO @vit/ui`. Track 1 (`packages/ui`) lands the real
  components; the swap is a mechanical import change through `src/tmp-ui/index.ts`.
- Tokens (cream/butter/status/Onest) live in `src/styles/app.css` from the
  approved prototype; Track 1 will own the canonical token set.
